  "ownedContract": [
    "DPI scales measurement and paint together; default72 units/inch and .71 child script sizing.",
    "Scoped shaping/outline and color-font paint bounds share cancellation and budgets without installed-font lookup.",
    "Compact nested fractions reduce child em rather than the complete expression.",
    "Inline neighbor painted baselines and aligned math decoration boxes agree.",
    "PDF drawing glyphs preserve centered frame, baseline and synthetic style; positioned small scripts retain their em."
  ],
